    "within": "Questions 1 to 3 put parts together for 4, then 5 as 4 and 1, then 5 as 3 and 2. Question 4 is the part-whole cherry for what goes with 2 to make 4. Question 5 taps extra slots for what goes with 2 to make 5. Questions 6 and 7 tap four tiles to find one pair that makes 5, first 0 and 5, then 1 and 4. Question 8 taps every pair that makes 4. Question 9 taps extra slots for what goes with 4 to make 5. Question 10 is a short story: Sam has 2 and gets 3 more. Starts at 4.",
